---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quality Control at Scale: How Fitclo Manages 450,000 Pieces Monthly"
  description="Discover the rigorous 4-stage quality control system that ensures zero defects for large-scale activewear wholesale orders."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Quality Assurance</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Quality Control at Scale: Our <span class="text-accent italic">Zero-Defect Protocol</span></h1>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>10 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">When a $30,000 order lands in your warehouse, the last thing you want is a 5% defect rate. In high-volume retail, a "minor" error becomes a major liability.</p>

      <p>At Fitclo, we manage a monthly output of <strong>450,000 pieces</strong>. To maintain the standards required by premium Western brands, we've implemented a 100% inspection protocol that goes beyond the industry standard AQL 2.5.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">The 4-Stage QC System</h2>
      <ol class="space-y-8">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-black">1. Raw Material Audit (IQC):</strong> Every roll of Nylon/Spandex fabric is tested for GSM (weight), stretch recovery, and colorfastness before it ever hits the cutting table.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-black">2. In-Line Inspection (IPQC):</strong> Our supervisors perform random checks every hour at each sewing station to ensure seam strength and stitch density (especially for 4-needle 6-thread flatlock seams).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-black">3. Full Garment Testing (FQC):</strong> Unlike factories that sample-test, we inspect every single finished garment for loose threads, symmetrical alignment, and labeling accuracy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-black">4. Pre-Shipment Audit (OQC):</strong> A final review of packaging, barcoding, and carton integrity ensures your $30k shipment arrives retail-ready.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="my-12 relative rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
        <img src="/images/migrated/third-party/hcc2d5570d1a94d4ea98d26ce3312893dj-2b46b82f20.webp" alt="QC Inspection" class="w-full h-auto" />
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Why Certification Matters for Big Buyers</h2>
      <p>We are SGS and ISO certified. For large-scale importers in the US and EU, this isn't just a plaque on the wall—it's your insurance policy. Our documentation ensures your products meet international safety and performance standards, essential for mid-to-high end retail placement.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Secure Your Supply Chain</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Request our full QC documentation and factory audit report.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">Download Audit Report</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
